@host = http://localhost:5023

### Health check (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Sign in as the seeded admin
# @name login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@employeehub.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

### Capture the token from the login response for the requests below
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Account lifecycle
#
# These have no UI yet. The dev IEmailSender writes messages to the API console,
# so the verification and reset links below are copied out of the backend log.
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Register — creates an unverified account and returns no token on purpose
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.starter@employeehub.local",
  "password": "Str0ngPassword!"
}

### Signing in before verifying is rejected
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.starter@employeehub.local",
  "password": "Str0ngPassword!"
}

### Verify — paste the token from the verification link in the API console
POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_VERIFICATION_TOKEN_HERE"
}

### Forgot password — always 200, even for an unknown address
POST {{host}}/api/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "new.starter@employeehub.local"
}

### Reset — paste the token from the reset link in the API console (valid for 1 hour)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "PASTE_RESET_TOKEN_HERE",
  "newPassword": "AnotherStr0ngPassword!"
}

###
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data endpoints
# --------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Dashboard stats (trimmed for non-managers)
GET {{host}}/api/dashboard/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Employee directory (Manager or Admin only — 403 for an Employee token)
GET {{host}}/api/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Departments (readable by any signed-in user)
GET {{host}}/api/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Positions
GET {{host}}/api/positions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Leave requests — all of them for a manager, own records only otherwise
GET {{host}}/api/leave-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### User accounts (Admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
